    "Direct text-object traversal bypasses CPDF_TextPage and uses existing doc2struct layout and standardization.",
    "Streaming discards supported text objects after emitting their glyphs; it still allocates each temporary text object and keeps nontext page objects. It does not remove all intermediate page construction.",
